{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も一日お疲れちまぁ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は横浜で個別握手会でした☆\n暑い中、会いに来てくださったみなさんありがとうございました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/07/27/1899499/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんから頑張る気力をいただきましたぁ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にひなちまふぁみりーさん大好き♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は残念ながら、大草原の小さなお部屋でお留守番のみなさん..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/07/27/1899499/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣姿のエアー握手♡\nひなちまってる(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の個別握手会は、浴衣姿でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りの水色の浴衣♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/07/27/1899499/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑歌舞伎を習っていた頃のお稽古は浴衣で行っていたので、思い出しながら自分で着ました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、メイクさんにも少し手伝っていただいたよぉ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/07/27/1899499/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑髪型は初めての編み込みまとめ♪\nそして、水色のお花もつけました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣でまたお祭りいきたいな♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、5部の前に乃木坂ふぁみりーのみなさんとろってぃーの生誕祭☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"控室にいたのですが、Birthdayソングが聴こえてきたので思わず会場に飛び出しちゃいました(o^^o)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、浴衣も着替えてラフな私服で飛び出してしまったので...\n少し恥ずかしかったです...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーバーオール♪\n日奈の中では末っ子ファッションと名付けています。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/07/27/1899499/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーおめでとう(o^^o)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【7月27日K9さん】\n【7月27日せーやさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【7月28日怪傑アリババさん】\n【7月28日みっくるさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆HAPPY BIRTHDAY☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年になります様に☆*:.｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も皆さんにとって、幸せでありますように☆*:.｡."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかり身体を休めてくださいね(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も短いですが、次のブログは大草原の小さなお部屋でお話しタイムにしまぁす♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではおやすみなさい☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈"}],"source":"archive"}